      "filename": "Operator hierarchy one and three dimensions for hierarchy.gif",
      "title": "File:Operator hierarchy one and three dimensions for hierarchy.gif",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/Operator_hierarchy_one_and_three_dimensions_for_hierarchy.gif",
